<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">18082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>A projectile struck the engine room of a merchant ship leaving the Strait of Hormuz, killing one crew member... the first hull hit since the waterway began closing.</s> <s>Until now the strait was closing commercially — war-risk premiums and owners' refusals had taken transits toward zero without a shot fired at a civilian vessel.</s> <s>Insurance can be repriced in a morning, but a demonstrated willingness to strike merchant crews can't be unlearned.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Hakainde Hichilema won a second term in Zambia with sixty percent of the vote, and cost-of-living anger nearly took it from him.</s> <s>He spent his entire first term inside a debt restructuring under the G20 Common Framework, negotiating with Chinese and private bondholders after the twenty-twenty default — and austerity reaches fuel and mealie-meal prices years before relief reaches growth.</s> <s>That gap between macro repair and what a household feels at the till is the same one now facing Ghana, Sri Lanka and Ethiopia.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>President Trump threatened to bomb Oman — the mediator, not the adversary.</s> <s>Muscat has carried every message between Washington and Tehran since the Islamabad memorandum, which lapsed Monday after sixty days with no deal, and mediation only works while the mediator stays immune from the quarrel.</s> <s>Threatening the go-between doesn't escalate against Oman so much as close the last channel that was still open.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Trump also cited India's electoral system as his model for mandatory voter identification, pointing to six hundred and forty-six million voters who he said all held valid papers.</s> <s>An identification requirement isn't a property of voters, it's a filter — and its politics live entirely in who fails it: women whose names changed at marriage, internal migrants, the very poor, and where citizenship itself is contested, Muslims.</s> <s>India's rolls rest on a universal state-issued identity card that America doesn't have, so the comparison breaks before the policy even does.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A judge in Ann Arbor threw out felony charges against Hiab Teshome, a graduate union leader accused of misusing club funds — an accusation both university and student auditors found no evidence for.</s> <s>She led contract negotiations under felony exposure for months, which is the point: in a prosecution like this the harm is delivered by the charging decision, not the verdict.</s> <s>The charges were dropped is never the reassuring sentence it sounds like, because everyone who watched them filed has already learned what assembly costs.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Lawmakers in Nigeria's Akwa Ibom state have been locked out of their own chamber for nine months.</s> <s>Rehabilitation of the assembly received fifteen point four seven billion naira and stalled, while tourism projects worth two hundred forty-eight point eight three billion naira race toward a September opening — and a legislature's only real leverage is sitting, holding hearings and summoning officials.</s> <s>No law was repealed; the institution simply stopped meeting while the spending it exists to review accelerated.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's Supreme Court acquitted three men sentenced to death for the twenty-fourteen mob killing of Shahzad and Shama Masih, a Christian brick-kiln couple beaten and burned alive over a blasphemy allegation.</s> <s>The court cited contradictions — no relative of the couple signed as a witness or filed the complaint — and that's the structural problem with lynching cases: the crime is committed by a crowd, so identification rests on witnesses who live among the accused and fade across a decade.</s> <s>An acquittal for insufficient evidence isn't a finding that the killing didn't happen, and a hundred and five other acquittals already stand.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Mexico's Guerrero state, fifteen families walked back into Chilapa after two months away, part of a displacement of more than a thousand Indigenous residents that a single arrest reversed.</s> <s>Los Ardillos are small beside the national cartels, yet they hold several municipalities through political ties rather than manpower.</s> <s>That's what makes the reversal fragile — what one arrest undid, one accommodation can restore.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Six months into war and blockade, Iran's spring output fell just zero point two one percent against the same quarter a year earlier.</s> <s>Valuing that economy at the free-market exchange rate makes it look like disintegration, but currency depreciation isn't the same event as a fall in goods produced — on constant prices, output per person still runs above twenty-eighteen, when maximum pressure began.</s> <s>The cost is real and it's landing on households: half a million jobs gone, unemployment past nine percent, and cash transfers now funded by printing money.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Oil's share of Kazakhstan's exports fell from fifty-two point nine percent to forty-six point five percent in a year, and that isn't diversification succeeding.</s> <s>Roughly eighty percent of Kazakh crude reaches world markets through one pipeline to Russia's Novorossiysk port, repeatedly struck by drones — so a doubly landlocked producer doesn't have export capacity, it has export permission.</s> <s>Those figures come from Kazakhstan's own statistics bureau, reported by Russian state media in a dispute where Moscow is an interested party.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Abu Dhabi is expanding through the same blockade that's strangling its neighbours.</s> <s>Adnoc's Habshan to Fujairah line loads crude on the Gulf of Oman side, skirting Hormuz entirely, which converts a regional catastrophe into a competitive advantage over every rival exporter still paying freight premiums.</s> <s>Infrastructure built years ago for redundancy is now the difference between a customer and a casualty.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Diesel in Pakistan rose six rupees forty-seven paisa to three hundred ninety rupees forty-two a litre.</s> <s>Diesel runs freight, tube wells and tractors, so a pump increase arrives at food prices within weeks — and Islamabad now resets prices daily against global crude, tying every household to the strait.</s> <s>The dealers' association is weighing a protest.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Pentagon awarded Raytheon a twenty-two point nine billion dollar Tomahawk contract, while analysts found Patriot and <sub alias="thad">THAAD</sub> stocks roughly halved since February.</s> <s>Precision missiles depend on a thin single-supplier base with multi-year lead times, so inventory can't be bought back at the speed it's fired.</s> <s>Spending money is fast; building a second production line isn't.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Spanish researchers reconstructed four centuries of use inside a single chamber of tomb TT two hundred and nine in the Theban Necropolis, from the twenty-fifth dynasty to the Ptolemaic period.</s> <s>They read it through plant remains, insects and sediment layers rather than inscriptions — stratigraphy turning accumulated debris into a sequence, with not a single date written on a wall.</s> <s>What emerges isn't treasure but a working society economising on its dead, a place built for one owner that became municipal infrastructure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Leh Nullah rose to twenty feet through Rawalpindi after one morning of monsoon rain, sirens sounding along its banks as rescuers pulled nine people from the water and traders counted losses in the millions.</s> <s>Decades of construction narrowed the channel and sealed the floodplain under concrete, so the same rainfall now becomes runoff almost instantly — the hydrograph changes even before the climate does.</s> <s>Channel-widening has been promised since the two thousand one flood, and the people on those banks are there because it was the affordable land.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Conservation funding worldwide is being allocated on species data that's years out of date.</s> <s>Researchers trace the worst delay not to sensors but to taxonomic identification, which depends on a shrinking pool of specialists — so the richest habitats, the Congo basin among them, are the ones most systematically under-counted.</s> <s>Money follows evidence, and the evidence is thinnest exactly where life is densest.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>GitHub went down and builds, deployments and package installs failed worldwide — including at organisations that have no account and never chose it as a dependency.</s> <s>Open-source supply chains resolve transitive dependencies to GitHub addresses, so a package three levels down someone's tree quietly makes one company's outage everyone's outage.</s> <s>Nobody voted for a single point of failure... it accreted, and the fixes — mirrors, vendored code, pinned artifacts — are skipped because their cost is immediate while the outage's is diffuse.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A debt-relief website exposed the Social Security numbers and financial records of seven hundred and fifty thousand people, many of whom never became customers at all.</s> <s>They'd only inquired about a loan through a third party, and lead-generation forms get resold to multiple lenders who each keep the full application indefinitely, whether or not anything closed.</s> <s>The breach reveals a record most of those people didn't know existed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>One American police officer ran an ex-girlfriend's licence plate a hundred and seventy-nine times through Flock's camera network.</s> <s>The company confirmed it doesn't verify the case numbers officers type before running a search — so the surveillance lives in the retention and search defaults, not in the cameras themselves.</s> <s>Cities are now cancelling contracts, which is the slowest possible way to discover what a setting was doing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers released mAIEnergy, an open dataset harmonising fifty thousand documents, twenty thousand images and twenty-five million time-series records for the power sector.</s> <s>Models that pass professional exams fail at grid operations because the sector's real knowledge lives in single-line diagrams, relay settings and SCADA logs — formats no web crawl contains, so the capability gap is a data-access gap.</s> <s>Grids outside Europe, North America and China are barely represented in what will define competence, and those are the ones most in need of help.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>